# Prose and hand-maintained config.
#
# Prettier owns code — TypeScript, JavaScript, JSON. It does not own the prose, and
# the line is drawn deliberately rather than by omission:
#
#   * Markdown here uses meaningful line breaks, aligned tables and callouts written
#     to a 100-column budget. Reflowing them produces large diffs that say nothing,
#     and PRD.md / PED.md are transcriptions where fidelity to the source matters.
#   * YAML here is read by tools (TASKS.yaml, budget.yaml, usage-model.yaml) and by
#     people deciding whether a gate is right. Its shape is part of its argument.
#
# The docs are not ungated: links, anchors and line endings are all checked by
# `make verify`. They are just not reformatted.
*.md
*.yaml
*.yml

# Deliberately ill-formed; they exist to prove the gates are not vacuous.
